#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:5
#: 7b4909894d0342ae84b9d8b248feb54d
msgid "First Person View (FPV)"
msgstr "第一人称视角（FPV）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:7
#: e1f8fb141b1847939b1eb5b25525ecbf
msgid ""
"*First Person View* provides you with a true pilot's eye view while flying "
"by placing a video camera and transmitter on your vehicle paired with a "
"receiver and either an LCD or goggles on the ground.  An optional OSD (On "
"Screen Display) helps maintain orientation by providing aircraft instrument "
"overlay on your FPV monitor."
msgstr ""
"*第一人称视角*通过在飞行器上安装摄像头和图传发射机，并在地面配备接收机和LCD显示器或护目镜，为您提供真实的飞行员视角。可选的OSD（屏幕显示）通过在FPV监视器上叠加飞机仪表数据来帮助维持方向感。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:17
#: a85cce255a0c40c4a595d1a0013cee42
msgid "Recommended parts"
msgstr "推荐配件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:19
#: 66560100faaf40e988065a545f9e9a4d
msgid ""
"To set up an FPV system on your Copter/Plane equipped vehicle you will need:"
msgstr "为Copter/Plane配置FPV系统，您需要："

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:22
#: c7c13e17b34343a0929e4548e0cafff7
msgid ""
"Miniature video camera. The variety of cameras increases daily. Most now "
"support resolutions of 600-1200 TVL (TV Lines) and have wide supply range "
"tolerance (5-24V typically). Lens are available from wide-angle (<2.8mm) to "
"ultra-narrow (>5mm). For mini-quads, usually wide angle are used, while for "
"planes, normal field of view/focal lengths (2.8mm-3.6mm) are usually used. A"
" wide selection are easily found by searching the internet for ``FPV "
"Camera``."
msgstr ""
"微型摄像头。摄像头种类与日俱增。大多数现在支持600-1200 "
"TVL（电视线）的分辨率，并具有宽泛的供电电压范围（通常为5-24V）。镜头从广角（<2.8mm）到超窄角（>5mm）均有提供。对于微型穿越机通常使用广角镜头，而固定翼通常使用普通视角/焦距（2.8mm-3.6mm）。通过搜索"
" ``FPV Camera`` 可以轻松找到丰富的选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:23
#: 2e433bc97d39417585ae58777749331e
msgid ""
"5.8Ghz 25mw to 200mw video transmitter/receiver pair. Again, supply voltage "
"tolerances now easily accommodate 2s-4s Lipo batteries normally used as "
"vehicle power."
msgstr "5.8GHz 25mW至200mW视频发射/接收对。目前供电电压范围可轻松适配飞行器通常使用的2s-4s锂电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:24
#: 26d4a27275b84ac0a878b4f930282c2c
msgid ""
"OSD (On-Screen-Display). Many autopilots now integrate this function "
"directly. If not, external OSDs like `MinimOSD "
"<http://www.holybro.com/product/micro-osd-v2/>`__ can be used. Or, not used "
"at all. However, being able to see the battery status, flight data, etc. "
"makes a much more enjoyable flight!"
msgstr ""
"OSD（屏幕显示）。许多飞控现已直接集成此功能。若未集成，可使用外部OSD如 `MinimOSD "
"<http://www.holybro.com/product/micro-"
"osd-v2/>`__，或不使用OSD。但能看到电池状态、飞行数据等信息，会让飞行体验更加愉快！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:25
#: d531605cb95e4693a3fd7b82839152bd
msgid ""
"Separate batteries for powering the above are rarely needed now, since most "
"now accommodate the flight pack's voltage range from full to empty,"
msgstr "为上述设备单独准备电池现在很少需要了，因为大多数设备现已能适应飞行电池从满到空的电压范围，"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:27
#: 34b56a1627fa46fb8766275971284056
msgid ""
"In addition you will need a monitor like the `Black Pearl "
"<http://www.amazon.com/FlySight-Black-Pearl-Diversity-"
"Integrated/dp/B00KR69WHY>`__ or goggles."
msgstr ""
"此外，您还需要一个监视器如 `Black Pearl <http://www.amazon.com/FlySight-Black-Pearl-"
"Diversity-Integrated/dp/B00KR69WHY>`__ 或护目镜。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:30
#: 29bdda511cfe4c8abf5eabeddfe30a32
msgid "**Goggle options:**"
msgstr "**护目镜选项：**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:32
#: 1b3d24275c124abd9e422cee49b06a36
msgid ""
"`Fat Shark <http://www.fatshark.com/default.html>`__ has a wide range of "
"goggles including the \"Attitude\" and \"Dominator\" that have been proven "
"to work.  Note that some models come with a built in transmitter & receiver "
"that would replace the 3DR video kits 5.8 Ghz transmitter/receiver pair "
"mentioned above. SkyZone, Eachine, and others also make many models for FPV "
"use."
msgstr ""
"`Fat Shark <http://www.fatshark.com/default.html>`__ "
"提供多款护目镜，包括已被证实可用的「Attitude」和「Dominator」。注意某些型号内置了发射机和接收机，可替代上述5.8GHz发射/接收对。SkyZone、Eachine等品牌也生产多款FPV护目镜。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:37
#: 04b0d15658034555a3db2cddbf8ef257
msgid ""
"Low cost 320x240 resolution goggles (`example video "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tG-4JNpE2fc>`__) are not recommended "
"because the higher resolution 640x480 (`example video "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ywqacXyjcNw>`__) or SVGA goggles provide a "
"much better flying experience."
msgstr ""
"不推荐使用低成本的320x240分辨率护目镜（`示例视频 "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tG-4JNpE2fc>`__），因为更高分辨率的640x480（`示例视频 "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ywqacXyjcNw>`__）或SVGA护目镜能提供更好的飞行体验。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:41
#: 11ecc7b1a6b54cc59caf69fd2392aa51
msgid ""
"In addition you may wish to set-up a separate :ref:`camera gimbal <common-"
"cameras-and-gimbals>`\\ (perhaps with Go-Pro attached) to record the flight "
"in HD."
msgstr ""
"此外，您可能希望安装单独的 :ref:`云台 <common-cameras-and-gimbals>`\\ （可搭配GoPro）以高清录制飞行画面。"

