#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:53
#: ad9ac4c0efe544ebab06db7d6e12481c
msgid ""
"FPV equipment on the vehicle should be placed as far away as possible from "
"GPS and RC receiver to reduce the chance of interference."
msgstr "飞行器上的FPV设备应尽量远离GPS和遥控接收机，以降低干扰风险。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:57
#: 8f0418298b884ec3bb8c7d51f4d7067e
msgid "Minim OSD setup through mission planner"
msgstr "通过Mission Planner设置Minim OSD"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:59
#: 64b00d4c08df4254a651a21ae5843907
msgid ""
"The MinimOSD set-up guide :ref:`can be found here <common-minim-osd-quick-"
"installation-guide>`."
msgstr ""
"MinimOSD设置指南 :ref:`可在此处找到 <common-minim-osd-quick-installation-guide>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:62
#: eaf1c3b6745e47799cd9241b2898ac52
msgid "Integrated OSD"
msgstr "集成OSD"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:64
#: fb915c5daa644dc7b9c6b9b3867d0d50
msgid ""
"Many autopilots now integrate the :ref:`OSD function<common-osd-overview>` "
"on board, eliminating the need for an external device and reducing wiring."
msgstr "许多飞控现已集成 :ref:`OSD功能<common-osd-overview>`，无需外部设备并简化了接线。"

